  "notes": "Label = STM32 port name (Px_n) where printed next to the pin. Image 4: level-shifter pin names (U11 TXB0108YZPR B1-B8, U12 NTS0304EUKZ B2/B3), fuel-gauge names (A2 BATT, 32 THM/38 NT2P7) and PMIC BUCK SW2 included as functions. J2 pins 3 and 1 both map to B2 (on U11 and U12 respectively) as printed. Image 3: VOTP_PMIC warning (\"must be left unconnected, used only for factory programming\") not included; +3V3/D_P/D_N test points not transcribed. Image 5: header labels taken from the small board diagram only (no port names printed beside it); the microcontroller and WiFi module pin tables have no physical positions and are not transcribed. Image 6: J8 DCMI names that repeat the connector name (D0-D7) listed once; microphone, ToF and IMU chip pinouts are internal components, not transcribed. Reset button (NRST 4), RGB LED and charge LED not transcribed."
}